{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_02_end","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_02","title":"首輪競賽","storyCode":"DH-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"f7321d86ee237a7284391d93e3054bffd4a536e1f1149c70e7b54477013138e0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"好強，太強了！鼠膽龍威隊，在被三支隊伍聯手圍攻的局面之下，輕鬆將他們擊退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，林女俠在戰鬥中使用的究竟是什麼能力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"導播，切一下重播！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"只見林雨霞的手在身邊房屋的玻璃窗上輕輕一抹，玻璃如同熔化了一般緩慢消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而後，她的手中出現了一把鋒利的刀刃，這把刀刃幾近無色，只有反射陽光帶來的細微光芒證明著它確實存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"這一回終於看清楚了，林女俠居然能夠將玻璃轉化為武器，這真是令人意想不到的能力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到林女俠不光武藝高超，還有這般精彩的源石技藝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不過Missy，林小姐這是什麼能力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和鼠王一樣，其實她也是在操縱沙子，只是方向不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她從小能隨隨便便地把沙子變成玻璃什麼的，我經常問她要來玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，懂了，確實，玻璃也是用沙子做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我聽說鼠王可以用沙子搞出沙塵暴，林小姐行不行啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，不過我猜她就算會，也不會喜歡那麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，林小姐看起來不像是喜歡大開大合的類型。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"林女俠那防不勝防的源石技藝，配合陳女俠精準的銃法，還有埃內斯托先生的補漏，一次完美的視覺盛宴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，潘喬先生，您認為這次的勝利會屬於這支隊伍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支隊伍個人能力很強，不過配合還欠缺火候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，確實，在這樣的比賽中，如果過分強調個人能力，可是會被其他人盯上然後排除掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"歷史一再地向我們證明，只有團結才能夠取得最後的勝利！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個老頭眼光很尖啊，一眼就看出來老陳和林小姐現在最大的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，這兩個人，老陳嘛，跟你搭檔慣了至少知道配合，不過她完全不知道林雨霞是怎麼打的，自己又用的不是最拿手的劍，束手束腳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於林雨霞，這個女人就根本不知道配合這兩個字是怎麼寫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看好幾次她差點把老陳也傷到了，全靠老陳反應夠快閃了過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑死我了，不知道的還以為她們倆配合無間呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個叫埃內斯托的倒也聰明，根本沒往兩個人身邊靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然啊，他有幾條命都不夠用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯啊，Missy，觀察力越來越好了，我還以為我要給你講解一下呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了接過陳暉潔的位置我也是很努力的好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可從沒懷疑過這一點，只是沒想到Missy你的進步這麼快，真不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別一副老前輩的樣子在那感慨了，小心我扣你薪水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那可千萬別，您老大人有大量，別跟我一個小卒一般計較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這還像話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你還真別說，看她們這配合，讓我有點想起剛認識老陳的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她那時就這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，反過來，那時的她，和現在的林小姐差不多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓那時的她和現在的林小姐組隊，那恐怕真的打著打著她們兩個就打起來了，哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的玻璃刀好幾次差點割到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的水彈準頭也不怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來不只是情感上，戰術上我們也不適合組隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有說服力的結論，還是分頭行動吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我知道兩位彼此無法配合，不過既然組成了隊伍，那還是儘量像一支隊伍一樣行動吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前也說過，比賽途中無法通信，而且兩位不僅要找赤金，還想要調查可能存在的危險分子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然兩位的個人能力很強，但炎國不是有句話叫做——不怕一萬，只怕萬一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我的提議是，無論有沒有獲得赤金，我們一小時在這裡碰一次頭，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一方沒來，另一方見機行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，兩位願意配合那再好不過，那就這麼辦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林小姐走得真快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，你是打算單獨行動，還是讓我和你一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用為我和她考慮太多，我和她都不是為了賭氣能什麼都不管不顧的人，對的不會說成錯的，該做的還是會做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......平心而論，即使沒有合不合適的問題，分頭行動也是第一輪比賽中非常常見的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，我們只有三個人，我認為是沒有三人都分散出去的必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我還是跟你一起行動吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
